{"code": 1, "data": {"content": "<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">[收录于&nbsp; <strong><em><a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"/news/2455/content00844?type=0\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">#链活动&nbsp;</span></a></em></strong> 合集]</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #2576e8; font-size: 16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">引言</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">近年来，在新锐品牌崛起、传统品牌升级的繁荣市场中不乏佼佼者，如何才能在众多品牌中脱颖而出，成了所有企业要思考的重要课题，不仅要积极融入新经济、新业态，步入发展的快车道，还要拼产品、拼营销、更要拼供应链，供应链俨然成为各大品牌抢占消费者市场的重要手段。目前越来越多的企业通过京东物流了解一体化供应链，在合作的基础上不断探讨一体化供应链的更多可能。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">当下，国内经济还处于稳定上升的趋势，各行各业的竞争也如影随形，消费者需求分散、多渠道库存冗余以及多盘货管理带来的库存成本居高不下等问题困扰着不少企业。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">而作为中国拥有领先技术的一体化供应链物流服务商，京东物流既可以在数字世界提供基于数据与算法的供应链战略-规划-计划-执行的全面解决方案，又可以在物理世界提供从解决方案到落地运营的一体化支撑。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">随着数字经济时代到来，物流与供应链产业进入数字化引领的新阶段，不同垂直领域供应链特点各异，这就需要针对各特定行业的特点，量身定制一体化供应链解决方案。为了让更多客户了解京东物流一体化供应链的价值、为客户提供深度沟通交流的平台，京东物流特邀请不同行业大咖齐聚一堂，共同探讨一体化供应链行业发展要义，&ldquo;剧透&rdquo;一体化供应链背后那些事儿。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 20px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">大咖说第一季</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #3598db; font-size: 20px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">六位大咖精彩呈现</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/131921/19/30247/1424/632c28dfEf8899639/4bdabc888d8d5613.jpg\" /><span style=\"background-color: #236fa1;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"> </span><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #236fa1;\">攀升电脑物流总监张军：&ldquo;跟京东物流合作一体化供应链，超暖心&rdquo;。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/188688/23/29182/260220/632c29acE5fb3dd97/65c33dfe4441dc12.jpg\" /></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"background-color: #236fa1;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #236fa1;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/26667/12/19722/1511/632c292cE980e1cf3/dbc4aaf05d1ae029.jpg\" /><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"> </span></span><span style=\"color: #ffffff; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #236fa1;\">宜家宜居总经理石磊：&ldquo;跟京东物流合作一体化供应链，效率高&rdquo;。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/184348/27/28435/207477/632c29bdE91b75a5b/4aead08978dff1f7.jpg\" /></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/36786/25/18083/1586/632c294aE11a6dc8e/6824cf3698736820.png\" /></span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #236fa1;\">&nbsp;Keep仓储物流负责人张琪：&ldquo;跟京东物流合作一体化供应链，超给力&rdquo;。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/19731/35/18807/414311/632c29c5E8ae6bd43/48c539c6a0adacfc.png\" /></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/179415/31/28036/1762/632c295eE583462e4/640418c1fe85600f.png\" /></span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #236fa1;\">&nbsp;马孔多创始人、董事长艾国勇：&ldquo;跟京东物流合作一体化供应链，超省心&rdquo;。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/148975/23/29296/399695/632c29ccE497666d0/a624896159cafecb.png\" /></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/214669/16/21478/1248/632c296dEeb3f2c83/b1024953a80225ea.jpg\" /></span><span style=\"background-color: #236fa1;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #236fa1;\">&nbsp;芬腾电子商务有限公司总经理周柏鑫：&ldquo;跟京东物流合作一体化供应链，超安心&rdquo;。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/137606/3/29516/208853/632c29d4E08f8e2c5/47623e4d7fbd2e3d.jpg\" /></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/141500/19/29910/1443/632c297bEbc1b3e9d/47be97c117ab4366.png\" /></span><span style=\"color: #ffffff; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #236fa1;\">&nbsp;楚农家总经理刘修成：&ldquo;跟京东物流合作一体化供应链，超省本&rdquo;。</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/158314/40/30433/427370/632c29ddEc21063ce/b53b3fa3a53fa51f.png\" /></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">每位大咖都用金句对一体化供应链增添&ldquo;好评&rdquo;，这些认可都是对京东物流一体化供应链物流解决方案的最大肯定。通过&ldquo;一体化供应链大咖说&rdquo;IP，京东物流提供了和客户对话交流的平台，不仅复盘了已合作项目的精华，而且通过为3C、家居、消费品、服饰等客户提供的物流各环节、各场景解决方案，向行业充分展现了一体化供应链物流解决方案的优势，也让更多的客户愈加直观了解京东物流一体化供应链的核心价值。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">京东物流&ldquo;按需定制&rdquo;的一体化供应链物流解决方案，满足客户个性化、多样化需求，帮助不同类型的企业提升供应链效率的同时降本增效。面对数量庞大、领域多样的客户，京东物流加深对不同行业的理解，从而开发完善更加高效的供应链解决方案。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">如今，终端消费者碎片化、多样化、复杂化的需求，促使企业需要更为迅速灵活的供应链物流服务。京东物流一体化供应链将努力提升以数据与算法驱动为支持的运营自动化、管理数字化和决策智能化能力，以及基于需求理解的行业洞察与解决方案能力，进一步强化自身在一体化供应链服务的优势，扩大一体化供应链解决方案的广度和深度，以解决更多行业的特定痛点，面向更多行业和垂直领域，帮助客户降本增效。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://getwuce.jdl.com/#/diyForm?formCode=BD3187402377390195328&amp;channelL1Code=l1-ch8&amp;channelCode=wucech87219\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/158362/26/30995/43354/632c361dE1d682956/ff57a22ab4b979cd.png\" /></a></p>", "contentAbstract": "", "contentCode": "content00839", "contentTitle": "京东物流一体化供应链 助力客户价值升级", "contentType": 2, "createTime": 1663838712000, "id": 2451, "isDelete": 0, "link": "", "linkType": 0, "projectName": "京东物流官网", "srcUrl": "/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/183875/1/29252/72639/632c2b24E946b8de1/99afd6e8c485bee3.png", "updateTime": 1677148760000}}